        "original_id": "9d13c733-4cfc-5dc0-a3a4-1763c55a0673",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garth Brooks, Dewayne Blackwell, David Frizzell\n- Songs: \"Friends in Low Places\", \"Mr. Blue\", \"I'm Gonna Hire a Wino to Decorate Our Home\", \"The Thunder Rolls\"\n- Albums: \"No Fences\"\n- Charts: Billboard Top Country Albums\n\nFacts:\n- Dewayne Blackwell's songs included \"Mr. Blue\", which was a 1959 hit for the Fleetwoods.\n- Dewayne Blackwell's songs included \"I'm Gonna Hire a Wino to Decorate Our Home\", which was a 1982 hit for David Frizzell.\n- Garth Brooks performed the song \"Friends in Low Places\".\n- \"Friends in Low Places\" was released on August 6, 1990 as the lead single from Garth Brooks's album \"No Fences\".\n- Dewayne Blackwell's songs included \"Friends in Low Places\", which was a 1990 hit for Garth Brooks.\n- Garth Brooks's album \"No Fences\" was released on August 27, 1990.\n- \"No Fences\" reached number 1 on Billboard's Top Country Albums chart.\n- \"The Thunder Rolls\" was released in April 1991 as the fourth and final single from Garth Brooks's album \"No Fences\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "a13a3410-96b4-5c1f-9624-3219781a800d",
        "text": "Page: Friends in Low Places. Sentence: \"Friends in Low Places\" is a song performed by American country pop artist Garth Brooks.\nPage: Friends in Low Places. Sentence: It was released on August 6, 1990 as the lead single from his album \"No Fences\".\nPage: No Fences. Sentence: It was released on August 27, 1990, and reached #1 on \"Billboard's\" Top Country Albums chart.\nPage: Dewayne Blackwell. Sentence: His songs include \"Mr. Blue\", a 1959 hit for the Fleetwoods; \"I'm Gonna Hire a Wino to Decorate Our Home\", a 1982 hit for David Frizzell; and \"Friends in Low Places\", a 1990 hit for Garth Brooks.\nPage: The Thunder Rolls. Sentence: It was released in April 1991 as the fourth and final single from his album \"No Fences\".",
